      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "18° 说出你所知道的长度、面积、时间、质量的度量单位．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "19",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "19. 按递增的顺序排列各个量：",
        "1) $2\\mathrm{m}$，$305\\mathrm{cm}$，$24.2\\mathrm{dm}$，$2416\\mathrm{cm}$；",
        "2) $1050\\mathrm{kg}$，$1.5\\mathrm{t}$，$1052\\mathrm{q}$；",
        "3) $90$分钟，$3000$秒，$2$小时．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "20",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "20° 自己编应用题，要求解题时需要：1) 比较几个量的大",
        "小；2) 把几个量相加；3) 把几个量乘以数．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "21",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "21. 如果分别取1) 毫米作度量单位，2) 米作度量单位，3)",
        "公里作度量单位，求量$a=3\\mathrm{cm}$的数值．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "22",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "22° 1) 如果度量单位缩小为原来的十分之一，量的数值怎样",
        "变化？2) 如果度量单位扩大到100倍呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "23",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "23. 求下面两个量的比：1) $2$公里和$40$米；2) $3$吨和",
        "$50$公斤；3) $100$平方米和$4$公顷；4) $3$小时和$15$",
        "分钟．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "24",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "24. $1$海里等于$1.852$公里．1) $3$海里等于多少公里？$12$海",
        "里呢？$200$海里呢？2) $1$公里等于多少海里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "25",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "25. $1$俄里等于$1066.8$米．1) $a$俄里等于多少公里？2) $1$",
        "公里等于多少俄里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
